  <!-- Fixture for tests\ProjectFileTests: copied to the root of a scratch folder as Directory.Packages.props. NuGet.props imports the first
       Directory.Packages.props in the project's folder or a folder above it, as Microsoft.Common.props finds Directory.Build.props, so this
       one stops that search at the scratch folder and no such file in the temp folder or above it is read. It sets nothing: central package
       management stays off. A test that needs central package versions writes its own over it (or one in a project folder, found first). -->
</Project>
